{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring the party to your VR workouts with the PowerBeatsVR \u201cDisco Environment\u201d! This electrifying new add-on transforms your training space into a retro-inspired world of color, rhythm, and nonstop energy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a dance-fueled fitness celebration with pulsing lights, vivid visuals, and the unmistakable disco-era vibe as you punch, dodge, and sweat your way to peak performance. Whether you're chasing gains or just love to move, this immersive setting adds that extra spark of joy and keeps you coming back for more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for high-intensity routines or rhythm-driven fun, the Disco Environment makes every workout feel like a celebration. Pair it with your favorite track and train like you're inside a neon-lit party.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add it to your collection and keep your VR fitness journey fresh, fun, and fully charged.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3598630?t=1756320496","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598630/c2229ae1c12f77e488917057e97b078664f63091/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756320496","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598630/f2febfb1bc058f944c1ca99294f4dd68c91e8c58/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756320496","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598630/f2febfb1bc058f944c1ca99294f4dd68c91e8c58/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756320496","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring t